@model IPFMMS.Models.SharedFinance
@{ViewData["Title"]="Delete Shared Finance";Layout="_DashboardLayout";}
<div class="container-fluid py-4" style="max-width:850px"><h2 class="fw-bold">Delete Shared Finance</h2><partial name="_Messages"/><div class="card border-0 shadow-sm"><div class="card-body p-4"><h3 class="h5 fw-bold text-break">@Model.sharedFinanceName</h3><p>This removes the group from members' shared finance lists and stops new group activity. Invitations will no longer grant access.</p><p>Existing expenses and shared entry history are retained. Each person can still view their own entries and release their own remaining savings allocation from My entries &amp; allocations.</p><form asp-action="DeleteConfirmed" method="post"><input type="hidden" name="id" value="@Model.sharedFinanceId"/><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="@Model.revision"/><div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 justify-content-end"><a asp-action="Details" asp-route-id="@Model.sharedFinanceId" class="btn btn-outline-secondary">Cancel</a><button type="submit" class="btn btn-danger">Delete shared finance</button></div></form></div></div></div>
